# No Em Dashes

Never use em dashes (`—`) or en dashes (`–`) in commits, comments, docs, UI copy, chat replies, or any other text you write for this project.

## Replace with

| Avoid | Use instead |
|---|---|
| `—` (em dash) | `-` (hyphen-minus, U+002D) |
| `–` (en dash) | `-` (hyphen-minus, U+002D) |

## Examples

```text
# Bad
Upgrade packages — including Laravel and Pinia

# Good
Upgrade packages - including Laravel and Pinia
```

When editing existing files, replace any em/en dashes you touch with normal hyphens.
